    "body": "I agree with you, but I think we should describe it in more details. And since ILP32E(GCC) has been used by some customers, we should be careful of big changes.\r\n\r\nThere are some discussions three years ago (https://github.com/riscv-collab/riscv-gcc/issues/148), we may:\r\n* align stack to 8 bytes.\r\n* or pass arguments with size of 2*XLEN differently and write it in specification document.\r\n\r\nI am looking forward to your advice.\r\n\r\n",
    "created_at": "2022-03-28T04:53:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-03-28T05:37:42Z",
